posts.caption:
A fantastic #mondaymotivaton post today after announcing my 2026 plans yesterday at Motorcycle live! To say next season I will be competing in the World Sportbike Championship is unbelievable. 
-
After what was the most successful season for myself in 2025, I can’t wait to take my riding skills to the world paddock next year and show what I am capable of 🔥.
-
A massive shoutout to @hickyracer60 @officialtriumphracing & @phrperformance for giving me this incredible opportunity, I can’t wait to get the season underway 🔥
